    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Jungle Jive-l1 is the entry piece of our Forestia jungle series, built for children aged 3 to 9. A large flower-shaped canopy shades the tower, with a slide on one side and a swing beam on the other. That mix gives small children two very different things to do in a compact space: climbing up and sliding down, or taking turns on the swing. The product area is 14'8\" x 13'5\" and the safe play area is 20'8\" x 17'5\". It comes in Mango Yellow, and capacity is listed as 15 children. Jungle Jive-l1 is covered by a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. If you are planning a toddler zone, tell us your site size and we will suggest pieces to go around it."
